# textdomain: dw_core
# Simplified Chinese translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

SCORE @1=得分 @1
Gamepad: PS4/PS5 DualShock needs Settings -> Controls -> Gamepads -> Joystick type @= ps5. Xbox works on 'auto'. See GAMEPAD.md.=手柄：PS4/PS5 DualShock 需要 设置 -> 控制 -> 手柄 -> 摇杆类型 @= ps5。Xbox 使用“auto”即可。见 GAMEPAD.md。
Toggle the fullscreen world map=切换全屏世界地图
Player not found=未找到玩家
Spore Block=孢子块
Magma Block=岩浆块
Ice Crystal=冰晶
Dead Stone=死石
Embers=余烬
Ash=灰烬
Mud=泥巴
Glowing Crystal=发光水晶
Basalt=玄武岩
Mossy Stone=苔石
HARE WAITING — catch up!=野兔在等你——追上去！
HARE AT THE FINISH — fly to it!=野兔在终点——飞过去！
SLALOM! Stay on the hare=绕桩！紧跟野兔
HARE: BARREL ROLL! (double-tap A/D)=野兔：桶滚！（双击 A/D）
HARD TURN! S+A/D @= airbrake drift=急转弯！S+A/D @= 空气刹车漂移
TUNNEL! Slow down (S) and fly clean=隧道！减速（S）并精准飞行
CLIMB + DIVE! Shift down for extra speed=爬升 + 俯冲！按 Shift 向下获得额外速度
FINISH — @1  |  SCORE @2=终点——@1  |  得分 @2
Race finished in @1! Checkpoints @2/@3, score @4.=比赛完成，用时 @1！检查点 @2/@3，得分 @4。
Race failed — fighter destroyed.=比赛失败——战斗机被摧毁。
Greyhound race — chase the golden hare! /race stop cancels it=灵缇赛跑——追逐金色野兔！/race stop 可取消
Race cancelled.=比赛已取消。
No race is running.=当前没有比赛。
A race is already running — end it with /race stop.=已有比赛在进行——用 /race stop 结束。
You are not in a fighter.=你不在战斗机里。
Could not spawn the hare.=无法生成野兔。
RACE! Follow the golden hare!=比赛开始！跟上金色野兔！
Race started — follow the hare!=比赛开始——跟上野兔！
HARE @1 m  ·  CP @2/@3=野兔 @1 米  ·  检查点 @2/@3
Welcome to DoggioWars! You ARE the fighter — fly!=欢迎来到 DoggioWars！你就是那架战斗机——起飞吧！
Toggle the island radar (minimap)=切换岛屿雷达（小地图）
Radar OFF.=雷达已关闭。
Radar ON.=雷达已开启。
BARREL ROLL!=桶滚！
LOOPING!=筋斗！
IMMELMANN!=殷麦曼回旋！
BOOST!=加速！
Fighter destroyed! Respawning...=战斗机被摧毁！正在重生……
Debug: respawn your fighter at your position=调试：在你的位置重新生成战斗机
Fighter respawned!=战斗机已重新生成！
Fly to the nearest island; /island <biome> @= nearest of that biome=飞往最近的岛屿；/island <群系> @= 该群系最近的岛屿
Unknown biome '@1' (or none nearby). Biomes: @2=未知群系“@1”（或附近没有）。群系：@2
@1 island at (@2, @3, @4), r@=@5, @6 blocks away - it is right in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=@1 岛屿位于 (@2, @3, @4)，r@=@5，距离 @6 格——就在你正前方。请稍等它生成。
@1 island, r@=@2, was @3 blocks away - it is in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=@1 岛屿，r@=@2，距离 @3 格——就在你前方。请稍等它生成。
Moving to island.=正在前往岛屿。
Fly above coordinates: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=飞到坐标上空：/goto <x> <z> 或 /goto <x> <y> <z>
Usage: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=用法：/goto <x> <z> 或 /goto <x> <y> <z>
Flying to (@1, @2, @3).=正在飞往 (@1, @2, @3)。
Fly to the home island at the world origin=飞往世界原点的家园岛
Flying to the home island (0,0) - it will be in front of you.=正在飞往家园岛 (0,0)——它会出现在你前方。
Gamepad diagnostics: live view of sticks and pressed buttons=手柄诊断：实时显示摇杆和按下的按键
Gamepad diagnostics ON — press buttons and move the sticks, and watch what lights up mid-screen.=手柄诊断已开启——按下按键、移动摇杆，看看屏幕中央有什么亮起。
Gamepad diagnostics OFF.=手柄诊断已关闭。
Switch controls: fighter <-> submarine=切换操控：战斗机 <-> 潜艇
SUBMARINE: left stick @= thrust/strafe, look @= heading, X @= up, O @= down. Tricks and boost are off.=潜艇：左摇杆 @= 推进/平移，视线 @= 航向，X @= 上升，O @= 下降。特技和加速已关闭。
FIGHTER: classic flight controls.=战斗机：经典飞行操控。
CHECKPOINT @1/@2=检查点 @1/@2
